RINGKASAN
Architecture
Multi-chain ecosystem: PoS sidechain, zkEVM rollup, CDK app-chains, Miden STARK rollup, AggLayer interop layer, all settling to Ethereum. Modular design with shared bridging (AggLayer) and unified token (POL).

Core Components
PoS: Heimdall (consensus), Bor (execution), Validator Set, Bridge. zkEVM: Sequencer, Prover (zk-SNARK), Bridge, Contracts. CDK: Modular node, sequencer options, DA modes. AggLayer: Pessimistic proof generator, unified bridge contract. Miden: Miden VM, STARK prover, client-side proving. ID: Issuer node, verifier SDK, ZK circuits.

Audit Count
10+ major audits from Trail of Bits, PeckShield, CertiK, Sigma Prime, OpenZeppelin, Spearbit, Veridise, Halborn, AuditOne covering PoS, zkEVM, CDK, AggLayer, Miden, ID, Bridge.

Major Upgrade Count
12+ major upgrades: Mainnet launch (2020), Rebrand (2021), Hermez acquisition (2021), Edge release (2022), zkEVM testnet (2022), zkEVM mainnet beta (2023), CDK release (2023), AggLayer testnet (2023), POL migration (2024), AggLayer mainnet beta (2024), Miden mainnet beta (2025), PoS EIP-1559 (2024).

Open Threads
- zkEVM decentralized sequencer design belum final — roadmap Polygon 2.0 menyebut shared sequencer tapi spesifikasi teknis detail belum dipublikasikan
- AggLayer pessimistic proof challenge period duration dan parameter ekonomi (bond, slash) belum terdokumentasi lengkap di docs resmi
- Polygon Miden EVM compatibility layer (jika ada) — apakah akan ada transpiler Solidity ke MASM atau user harus menulis ulang kontrak
- CDK shared sequencer decentralization mechanism — apakah akan menggunakan EigenLayer restaking, POL staking, atau mekanisme lain
- On-chain slashing untuk PoS validator — status implementasi (belum live per 2024), desain ekonomi slash (percentage, conditions)
- zkEVM prover hardware acceleration (GPU/FPGA/ASIC) — apakah ada partnership atau R&D internal untuk specialized hardware
- AggLayer integration dengan non-Polygon chains (Arbitrum, Optimism, dll) — technical spec untuk cross-ecosystem pessimistic proofs
- Polygon ID on-chain revocation gas cost optimization — accumulator update cost di high gas periods
- State sync dan light client support untuk CDK chains — apakah ada standard light client seperti Ethereum sync committee
- Formal verification status untuk critical circuits (zkEVM, AggLayer, Miden) — apakah ada Coq/Isabelle proofs selain audit
- Polygon PoS checkpoint committee rotation mechanism — apakah ada on-chain randomness (VDF/VRF) atau governance-controlled
- Miden VM formal semantics dan specification document — apakah ada reference spec terpisah dari implementasi
- Cross-chain atomic transactions via AggLayer — apakah didukung native atau perlu application-level coordination
- POL token contract upgradeability — proxy pattern digunakan, admin multisig threshold, timelock duration
- zkEVM Type 1 equivalence target — roadmap untuk mencapai Type 1 (full Ethereum equivalence) vs current Type 2/3